# No tests (project policy)

Marco's decision (2026-07-27): **this solution has no automated tests of any kind.**

- **Do not** create, restore, or reference `WebShopABMATIC.Tests` (or any other test project).
- **Do not** add unit, integration, bUnit, SQL, API, Playwright, or snapshot tests.
- **Do not** add xUnit / NUnit / MSTest / bUnit / FluentAssertions / NSubstitute / coverlet packages for testing.
- **Do not** run `dotnet test` as part of delivery.
- **Do not** write test policy, test plans, or test-suite status into README / SPECs / AMENDMENTS / PATTERNS — this rule lives only in agent rules (`AGENTS.md`, `.claude/CLAUDE.md`, this file).
- Verification = `dotnet build` / manual checks by the owner.
